---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: ScopeCoverage[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for identifySeams. Inspect interfaces where one bidder excludes work as by others or assumes another trade provides prerequisites. Identify unowned functions and duplicated commitments, and distinguish acceptable overlap from double-charged or conflicting responsibility. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
